 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. QVERB.
 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
 SPECIAL-NAMES.
     QUERY STATUS IS WS-QSTAT.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01  WS-QSTAT    PIC 99.
 01  WS-HITS     PIC 9(4).
 01  WS-N        PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 MAIN-PARA.
     QUERY "BIGBAL" USING "CUST" FOR WS-N
         GIVING WS-HITS
         ON ERROR DISPLAY "ERR1 " WS-QSTAT.
     DISPLAY "A " WS-QSTAT " " WS-HITS.
     QUERY "NOSUCH" USING "CUST" FOR WS-N
         GIVING WS-HITS
         ON ERROR DISPLAY "ERR2 " WS-QSTAT.
     DISPLAY "B " WS-QSTAT.
     STOP RUN.
